{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If you see an object, approach it. Grab it if close, move and check it otherwise. Perform specified task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
